    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive in head first and enjoy this chaotic underwater experience!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008010/extras/4231f91694e9b889b4a6ace9a973a308.avif?t=1737470950\" width=128 height=128 /></span><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage Your Oxygen: You lose oxygen over time! Enemies drop oxygen bubbles to refill your meter. Keep up with it or suffer the consequences...<br></li><li>Enemy Drops: Speaking of enemies, they also have a chance to drop upgrades! These don't last forever, so take advantage of them while they last!<br></li><li>Permanent Upgrades: Before you go into battle you get to choose a permanent upgrade to change how you play the game. Be careful, there are drastic downsides to each upgrade. Read carefully!</li></ul></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008010/extras/206bfa093baddcab823efb37fb6891f6.avif?t=1737470950\" width=554 height=629 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008010/extras/7c3ff36e7b25d61f654f097f5c7b021c.avif?t=1737470950\" width=565 height=595 /></span>",
